下面假设裁后图作为中心锚点的矩形显示，显示坐标 Y 向上，无旋转、镜像或额外裁剪。crop 是原画布上的裁剪位置，不是图集打包后的纹理位置。原点在小图内的位置是 pivot−crop 的左上坐标；把它移到角色根节点的 (0,0)，就得到 offset。图片宽高与 offset 必须同时乘统一 scale。

保存为 sprite-pivot.mjs，用 node sprite-pivot.mjs 运行，无依赖。8192 与 16 是教学输入范围限制，不是引擎限制。代码只验证数值边界，不识别图中的真实脚底。

```javascript
/**
 * @file Restore a marked root point after cropping an original tutorial frame.
 * @author liliwei
 * @date 2026-11-19
 * @LastEditors liliwei
 * @LastEditTime 2026-11-19
 */

/** @param {object} frame Canvas, crop and pivot in top-left pixel coordinates.
 * @param {number} scale Uniform display scale. @returns {object} Centered quad size and Y-up offset. */
export function placement(frame, scale = 1) {
  const { canvas, crop, pivot } = frame;
  for (const [a, n] of [[canvas, 2], [crop, 4], [pivot, 2]]) {
    if (!Array.isArray(a) || a.length !== n ||
        !a.every(v => Number.isInteger(v) && v >= 0 && v <= 8192)) {
      throw new Error('Invalid frame coordinates');
    }
  }
  const [W, H] = canvas, [x, y, w, h] = crop, [px, py] = pivot;
  if (!W || !H || !w || !h || x + w > W || y + h > H ||
      px > W || py > H || !Number.isFinite(scale) || scale <= 0 || scale > 16) {
    throw new Error('Invalid frame bounds or scale');
  }
  return { size: [w * scale, h * scale],
    offset: [(x + w / 2 - px) * scale, (py - y - h / 2) * scale] };
}

const crops = [[44, 32, 40, 80], [40, 24, 52, 88], [36, 16, 64, 104]];
for (const [i, crop] of crops.entries()) {
  const p = placement({ canvas: [128, 128], crop, pivot: [64, 112] });
  const [x, y, w, h] = crop;
  const rawFoot = [64 - x - w / 2, y + h / 2 - 112];
  const fixedFoot = rawFoot.map((v, k) => v + p.offset[k]);
  console.log(JSON.stringify({ frame: i, rawFoot, offset: p.offset, fixedFoot }));
}
```
